# Front-end structure

Vue 3 + TypeScript + Vite SPA for the animal adoption system.

## Alias

Use `@/` for all `src/` imports (Vite `resolve.alias` + `tsconfig.app.json` `paths`).

```ts
import App from '@/App.vue'
import '@/styles/main.css'
```

Do not use deep relative imports (`../../../`) across `src/`.

## Where to put code

| What | Where | Example |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Public page | `src/views/public/pages/` | `HomePage.vue` |
| Panel page | `src/views/panel/pages/` | `AnimalListPage.vue` |
| Module chrome | `src/views/<module>/components/` | `PublicHeader.vue` |
| Shared UI | `src/shared/components/` | `BrandLogo.vue`, `AppIcon.vue`, `AnimalImage.vue` |
| Pinia store | `src/shared/stores/` | `auth.store.ts` |
| HTTP / API | `src/shared/api/` | `http.ts`, `auth.ts` |
| Shared composable | `src/shared/composables/` | `useAnimalsList.ts` |
| Routes | `src/router/` | `router/routes/public.ts` |
| Styles | `src/styles/` | `styles/main.css` |
| Unit tests | `src/**/__tests__/` | `src/shared/stores/__tests__/auth.store.spec.ts` |

Create a folder when the first file needs it. Do not add empty directories.

A file starts in its view module. Move it to `shared/` only when a second module (or the router) needs it.

## Styles

```
src/styles/
├── main.css      # Tailwind + daisyUI entry (import this once from main.ts)
├── layout.css    # App shell (html / body / #app)
└── tokens.css    # POA daisyUI theme and typography tokens
```

- Entry: `src/styles/main.css` — Tailwind + daisyUI (`themes: false`) + `tokens.css` + `layout.css`
- Global import: `src/main.ts` → `import '@/styles/main.css'`
- Theme: `poa` on `<html data-theme="poa">`. Fonts: Fraunces + Manrope via Google Fonts in `index.html`
- Scoped `@apply`: first line of `<style scoped>` must be `@reference "@/styles/main.css";`
- Put brand tokens only in `tokens.css`, not in components
- Animal photos are optional URLs. Render them through `AnimalImage`. Icons only through `AppIcon`

> See @vue-components-style.mdc for CSS conventions.

## Naming

| Kind | Convention | Example |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Vue components / pages | `PascalCase` | `AnimalCard.vue` |
| Stores | `*.store.ts` | `auth.store.ts` |
| Composables | `use*.ts` | `useAnimalFilters.ts` |
| Directories | `kebab-case` | `views/panel/` |

